OL,3,GNEWSAPM says he is 'open' to devolving
OL,4,Apolicing in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham says he is
OL,7,Fopen to the idea of giving the Welsh
OL,8,Fgovernment control of policing in
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FHis comments were a marked change in
OL,12,Ftone from what the UK government has
OL,13,Fpreviously said, with the idea rejected
OL,14,Fin the past.
OL,16,FBurnham said that while he could not
OL,17,Fmake promises, he would be "open to the
OL,18,Fconversation", and that with "wider
OL,19,Fpolicing reform" going on it was a
OL,20,F"good time to look at those issues".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
