OL,3,GNEWSAPM says he is 'open' to devolving
OL,4,Apolicing in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he played down any prospect of a
OL,7,Freview of the way Welsh public services
OL,8,Fare funded through the Barnett Formula.
